Third-party components

The application bundles third-party libraries whose licenses are compatible
with AGPL-3.0. The authoritative list is the dependency tree in `package.json`
and the lockfile. Principal components:

- React, React DOM — MIT
- Vite — MIT
- Tailwind CSS — MIT
- Radix UI — MIT
- shadcn/ui — MIT
- Lucide — ISC
- TipTap — MIT
- dnd-kit — MIT
- Recharts — MIT
- Geist and Geist Mono fonts — SIL Open Font License 1.1
- Firebase SDK — Apache-2.0
- Capacitor — MIT
- Cloudflare Workers types and Wrangler — MIT / Apache-2.0

Run `npx license-checker --summary` for the complete inventory with versions.

The name and logo are not covered by the license. See TRADEMARKS.md.
